==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|niedlich|lang=gmh}}, {{term|nietlich||well-pleasing, in-demand|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|nitliche|nītlīche|desirable|lang=goh}}, derivative of {{term|niot||desire|lang=goh}}, from {{proto|Germanic|neudaz|desire, drive, urge|lang=de}}. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|niudliko|niudlīko|zealously, carefully|lang=osx}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|neodlice|nēodlīċe|eagerly, earnestly, carefully, zealously, diligently, sedulously; greatly|lang=ang}}. More at {{l|en|need}}.

